# Assumptions: entry is into a process vessel with potential toxic atmosphere and rescue capability on site.
# Preventive barriers act before entry; mitigative barriers limit harm after a worker collapse.
bowtie "Confined-space entry"
hazard "Enclosed vessel with oxygen-deficient or toxic atmosphere"
topevent "Entrant exposed to hazardous atmosphere"
threat "Incomplete isolation of process lines"
  prevent "Lockout-tagout isolation"
  prevent "Blind installation verification"
threat "Residual toxic gas in vessel"
  prevent "Atmospheric testing before entry"
    escalation "Gas detector calibration overdue"
      barrier "Calibration and bump-test programme"
  prevent "Forced-air ventilation"
threat "Unauthorised entry"
  prevent "Confined-space entry permit"
  prevent "Attendant controls entry point"
consequence "Entrant loses consciousness"
  mitigate "Continuous personal gas monitor"
  mitigate "Standby rescue team"
consequence "Multiple-rescuer exposure"
  mitigate "Non-entry retrieval system"
  mitigate "Emergency rescue plan"
consequence "Production release during rescue"
  mitigate "Emergency process shutdown"
